# NOTE: this filesystem is case-insensitive (APFS default), so Data/ (source) and
# data/ (sqlite runtime dir) are the same physical directory here. Ignoring "data/"
# outright would also hide Data/*.cs from git. Ignore the sqlite artifacts by name
# instead, wherever they land.
assetdesk.db
assetdesk.db-shm
assetdesk.db-wal
